    "detailed_description": "<strong>Prepare for the gripping and lustful adult cosmic adventure! \ud83d\udd1e Explore different planets, build relationships, face betrayal and find trustworthy partners on your way to freeing the galaxy from Melonium exploitation!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/f7e672a1065428c665f9968759d6f813.poster.avif?t=1747066332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/f7e672a1065428c665f9968759d6f813.webm?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/f7e672a1065428c665f9968759d6f813.mp4?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Lust in Space</strong> \ud83d\udd1e\ud83e\ude90 is an adult point-and-click adventure revolving around an intriguing story, lore and character exploration, important decisions and fiery 18+ encounters - don\u2019t miss your chance to save the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/8d7725557cf281c31a036c46b94d0a95.poster.avif?t=1747066332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/8d7725557cf281c31a036c46b94d0a95.webm?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/8d7725557cf281c31a036c46b94d0a95.mp4?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Head out on an intergalactic quest as Leon, a Peace Corps agent from Araksis, a high-tech planet bathing in the rays of 2 suns and filled with futuristic technology. Everything starts with a mission to take a look at an abandoned Earth spaceship - you discover a deactivated android named Marion there, who reveals to you the plans of his creators.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/c3137e07990de83f01ae326620d29b35.poster.avif?t=1747066332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/c3137e07990de83f01ae326620d29b35.webm?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/c3137e07990de83f01ae326620d29b35.mp4?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you return home and learn more about the earthlings' struggles to find Melonium, a highly valuable material being nearly depleted now, you face betrayal from the person you trusted the most, which ends up in a series of twisted events - you\u2019ll even have to escape the prison at one moment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/53ceac06176e63a176349fb160e12867.poster.avif?t=1747066332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/53ceac06176e63a176349fb160e12867.webm?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/53ceac06176e63a176349fb160e12867.mp4?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Along the journey you\u2019ll make friends and enemies, visit various planets, discover the dangers of racing the unknown, reveal a fallen civilization and possibly even save the whole galaxy from impending doom.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/69fea22d72c932789d1d2254196fbb5d.poster.avif?t=1747066332\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/69fea22d72c932789d1d2254196fbb5d.webm?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094840/extras/69fea22d72c932789d1d2254196fbb5d.mp4?t=1747066332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dive into this space-faring rollercoaster with android Marion, witty smuggler Lilith, former dancer Esmeri and other characters as you explore Kasaar, Titanium, Melo-Ni and other thrilling planets to save the day together!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engaging and meaningful story - learn about the consequences of exploiting nature.<br></li><li>Diverse characters - outlaws, mutants, friends and betrayers, robots and agents.<br></li><li>3D graphics - we\u2019ve put a lot of work into visuals, animations and character design to take immersion to the next level!<br></li><li>Adult scenes - lewd content featuring various characters and environments will help you get a deeper understanding of people around you.<br></li><li>Choice-driven plot - make the right decisions and decide the fate of yourself, your close ones and maybe even the whole galaxy!<br></li><li>Intuitive game-design - you can use just one hand to explore all of this, and you\u2019ll probably need to \ud83d\ude09</li></ul>",
